  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the AWG EU Water Initiative - IRC INT Water &amp; Sanitation Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the AWG EU Water Initiative - IRC INT Water &amp; Sanitation Centre is a component of Support to the EU Water Initiative&apos;s Africa Working Group reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;70,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Water sector policy and administrative management, Public sector policy and administrative management, Rural development, Privatisation.</narrative>
  </description>
